# Backstop. data/ holds the live SQLite DB and real credentials
# (.claude-oauth-token, .cursor-api-key). The root .gitignore's `/data/` rule
# normally prunes this directory before git ever reads this file — but if that
# one line is ever edited away, this catches everything in here instead of
# nothing. Force-added, since the parent rule hides it: git add -f data/.gitignore
*
!.gitignore
